# redshift_datashare_schemas (Data Source)

Lists the schemas of the outbound datashares in one producer database, with their future-object inclusion, as
`redshift_datashare_schema` manages them. See AWS
[SVV_DATASHARE_OBJECTS](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/redshift/latest/dg/r_SVV_DATASHARE_OBJECTS.html).

